# No Supabase

This repo is not the Zoie Supabase projects. Do not use the Supabase MCP, Supabase CLI, or any Zoie/Supabase project for Leadflow.

Use `DATABASE_URL` from `.env` with local `pg` (e.g. `/tmp/lf-pgq`) for campaigns, leads, and send logs. HubSpot is a separate read-only API.
